      "claim": "The announcement of 24 September 2026: what CLPR is and who contributed it (LFDT press release), and the quotes by Daniela Barbosa and Dr. Leemon Baird with their titles (reported the same day; the original Hedera release with the quotes was not found).",
      "checks": [
        "curl -sL https://www.linuxfoundation.org/press/lf-decentralized-trust-adds-swift-wells-fargo-and-13-additional-new-members | grep -o 'CLPR[^<]*' | head -5",
        "curl -sL https://genfinity.io/2026/09/24/hedera-hashgraph-clpr-linux-foundation-decentralized-trust-labs/ | grep -oE '(Cross ledger interoperability|Just weeks ago)[^<]*' | head -4"
      ],
      "recorded": {
        "date": "2026-11-04",
        "result": "LFDT release dated 24 September 2026: CLPR is a bridgeless cross-ledger messaging protocol lab contributed by Hedera and developed by the Hashgraph team; Barbosa's release quote does not mention CLPR and Baird is not quoted there. Genfinity (24 September 2026) carries both quotes as used on the site."
      }
